title: With Use Regular Expression on, a replacement of $1x is group one followed by an x (food becomes foox) in a replace-all
folders: edit-odd
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
forbid-log: nothing offers
forbid-log: script: ignoring
expect-file: edit-odd/words.txt :: (?-i)\nfoo foofoo foox\n

wait 3000
goto words.txt
wait 800
tool edit
edit words.txt 1 1
find-option regex on
find (fo+)d
wait 300
mark regex-matches
wait 450
find replace-all $1x
wait 500
mark replaced
wait 450
find close
key save
wait 800
quit
